{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hina-chan's phone has broken and can't text or make calls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this game, a sort of roguelite sticker deckbuilder, you'll help Hina-chan by selecting stickers to send to her friends Nitori, Suika, and Joon to avoid suspicion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, if they ask you what you ate for breakfast, you could use a meat sticker and they'll interpret that as you saying you had meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you could use an X sticker, which they'll interpret as you saying you didn't have anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But of course, you could also send the wrong stickers and just watch how they react instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > That might be fun too. Gather useful stickers and cards to survive all the chats, and help Hina-chan make it through all the way 'til the end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is a Touhou Project fangame.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3270920?t=1753678674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3270920?t=1753678674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270920/74cd54fb1e5357f2a5b6761a77bdc804831f7ddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753678674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270920/74cd54fb1e5357f2a5b6761a77bdc804831f7ddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753678674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hina-chan's phone has broken and can't text or make calls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this game, a sort of roguelite sticker deckbuilder, you'll help Hina-chan by selecting stickers to send to her friends Nitori, Suika, and Joon to avoid suspicion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, if they ask you what you ate for breakfast, you could use a meat sticker and they'll interpret that as you saying you had meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you could use an X sticker, which they'll interpret as you saying you didn't have anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But of course, you could also send the wrong stickers and just watch how they react instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > That might be fun too. Gather useful stickers and cards to survive all the chats, and help Hina-chan make it through all the way 'til the end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is a Touhou Project fangame.</p>","developers":["ISY"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270920/a67ece609bd1a5035e13b581426690a1af96ee77/header.jpg?t=1753678674","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3270920/1559658996/00bedba7d44063f692095170cad7aaf8e6094a2c/1753228373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753238367","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3270920/1559658996/00bedba7d44063f692095170cad7aaf8e6094a2c/1753228373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753238367","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3270920/1559658996/00bedba7d44063f692095170cad7aaf8e6094a2c/175